# SHIZUSTORE — COMPLETE ANDROID APP-STORE DEVELOPMENT SPECIFICATION

You are an expert senior Android engineer, product architect, UI/UX designer, security engineer, DevOps engineer, and open-source marketplace developer. Behave like a professional engineering team building a production-grade Android application at Google-level quality.

Build a complete Android application named **ShizuStore**.

This is NOT a simple APK downloader.

It must be a complete, beautiful, beginner-friendly, modern Android application store focused on open-source Android applications, Shizuku-powered applications, root-powered applications, system tools, utilities, customization tools, privacy applications, developer tools, games, and other useful Android software.

The application must feel like a real production Android app store rather than a GitHub wrapper.

The final application must be:

* Fast
* Beautiful
* Beginner-friendly
* Extremely smooth
* Secure
* Offline-capable
* Accessible
* Animated
* Responsive
* Battery-conscious
* Network-efficient
* Open-source friendly
* Developer friendly
* Power-user friendly
* Shizuku aware
* Root aware
* Installer aware
* Automatically synchronized
* Capable of handling thousands of applications
* Capable of handling pre-release versions
* Capable of handling multiple APK architectures
* Capable of handling APK updates
* Capable of handling split APKs when possible
* Capable of generating installable APK builds through GitHub Actions

Do not build a prototype.

Build the application architecture as if it will be published and maintained for years.

