# 27. BACKGROUND SYNC

Use WorkManager.

Default:

Periodic sync.

Recommended:

Every 6–12 hours depending on Android background restrictions.

Also sync:

* On application launch
* On manual refresh
* When network becomes available
* After significant time has passed
* After repository configuration changes

Do not aggressively wake the device.

Respect Android battery restrictions.

---

# 28. SMART SYNC

Do not download everything on every sync.

Use:

ETag

Last-Modified

Release IDs

Commit SHA

Version code

Version name

Timestamp

Content hash

Only download changed data.

For example:

If repository metadata has not changed:

Do nothing.

If application release changed:

Update only that application.

If icon changed:

Download only the icon.

If screenshots changed:

Download only changed screenshots.

